"This is also indicated in the 'Process State' column by symbols ▼ and ▲ respectively." = "这也会分别通过“进程状态”列中的 ▼ 和 ▲ 符号表示。";
"This is the default priority set for newly created threads. Tap the process and go to 'Threads' pane to see actual priorities and scheduling schemes of existing threads." = "这是新建线程的默认优先级。轻点进程并打开“线程”页面，即可查看现有线程的实际优先级和调度策略。";
