"Device and iNode of Module on Disk" = "磁盘上模块的设备与 iNode";
"Full command line with path and arguments.\n\nIf the name is given in brackets, then the command line cannot be acquired - usually it's either the Kernel or a zombie process.\n\nSummary of this column shows the total number of processes." = "包含路径和参数的完整命令行。\n\n如果名称在括号中，则无法获取命令行——通常是内核或僵尸进程。\n\n此列汇总显示进程总数。";
"Unique ID of a BSD process.\n\nThis always grows upwards. Kernel is always pid 0, launchd is pid 1." = "BSD进程的唯一ID。\n\n此编号递增。内核的 PID 始终为 0，launchd 的 PID 为 1。";
"Unique ID of process' parent - the one that called exec()/fork().\n\nOn iOS most processes are jobs, thus they are launched by launchd and have parent pid 1." = "父进程的唯一 ID，即调用 exec()/fork() 的进程。\n\n在iOS上，大多数进程都是作业，因此它们由launchd启动，并且具有父pid 1。";
"The sum of CPU usage by all threads of a process.\n\nCPU usage is expressed in % per CPU core, thus it sums up to cores×100%. Sometimes it can even exceed this value, due to reasons explained in this app's 'About' section. This is hilarious!\n\nSummary of this column indicates total CPU usage." = "进程中所有线程的CPU使用量之和。\n\nCPU 使用率以每个 CPU 核心的百分比表示，因此合计可达核心数 × 100%。有时甚至会超过此值，原因见本应用的“关于”部分。这很有趣！\n\n此列的摘要表示CPU的使用总量。";
"Total CPU time taken by the process - summed for all CPU cores.\n\nSummary of this column indicates OS uptime since kernel boot." = "进程占用的总CPU时间-所有CPU核心的总和。\n\n此列的摘要指示自内核启动以来的操作系统正常运行时间。";
"Process state (similar to original top).\n\nCan be one of the following:\nR\tRunning: at least one thread within this process is running now\nU\tUninterruptible (Stuck): a thread is waiting on I/O in a system call\nS\tSleeping: all threads of a process are sleeping\nI\tIdle: all threads are sleeping for at least 20 seconds\nT\tTerminated: all threads stopped\nH\tHalted: all threads halted at a clean point\nD\tThe process is stopped by a signal (can be used for debugging)\nZ\tZombie: awaiting termination or 'orphan'\n?\tRunning state is unknown (access to threads was denied)\n\nAdditional process attributes can follow:\n▼\tNice: lower priority, also see 'Nice' column\n▲\tNot nice: higher priority\nt\tDebugged process is being traced\nz\tProcess is being terminated at the moment\nw\tProcess' parent is waiting for this child after fork\nK\tThe system process (kernel)\nB\tApplication is suspended by SpringBoard (iOS specific)\n\nSummary of this column shows two numbers: the first one is the count of processes in running state, the second one is the number of CPU cores. Sometimes there are more running processes than there are CPU cores, but this is just a glitch due to kernel state changing while data is collected." = "进程状态(和原来的top类似)。\n\n可以是以下内容之一：\nR\t运行：进程中至少有一个线程正在运行\nU\t不可中断（阻塞）：线程正在系统调用中等待 I/O\nS睡眠：进程的所有线程都在睡眠\nI  Idle：所有线程至少休眠20秒\nT已终止：所有线程已停止\nH停止：所有线程在干净的点停止\nD进程被信号停止（可用于调试）\nZ   僵尸进程:正在等待终止或者已经成为孤儿进程的进程。”\n？运行状态未知（拒绝访问线程）\n\n其他过程属性如下：\n▼\t较低优先级，另请参阅“Nice”列\n▲\t更高优先级\nt\t调试进程正在被跟踪\nZ进程目前正在终止\nW进程的父进程正在fork之后等待此子进程\nK\t系统进程（内核）\nB\t应用已被 SpringBoard 挂起（仅限 iOS）\n\n该列的摘要显示了两个数字：第一个是处于运行状态的进程数，第二个是CPU内核数。有时运行的进程比CPU内核多，但这只是由于收集数据时内核状态发生变化而导致的故障。";
"Process flags represented as a hexadecimal number.\n\nThis is a bitmask composed of the following:\n0001\tP_ADVLOCK\t\tProcess may hold POSIX adv. lock\n0002\tP_CONTROLT    \tHas a controlling terminal\n0004\tP_LP64 \t\t\t64-bit process\n0008\tP_NOCLDSTOP \tBad parent: no SIGCHLD when child stops\n0010\tP_PPWAIT    \t\tParent is waiting for this child to exec/exit\n0020\tP_PROFIL    \t\tHas started profiling\n0040\tP_SELECT    \t\tSelecting; wakeup/waiting danger\n0080\tP_CONTINUED  \tProcess was stopped and continued\n0100\tP_SUGID\t\t\tHas set privileges since last exec\n0200\tP_SYSTEM    \t\tSystem process: no signals, stats or swap\n0400\tP_TIMEOUT\t\tTiming out during sleep\n0800\tP_TRACED    \t\tDebugged process being traced\n1000\tP_DISABLE_ASLR\tDisable address space randomization\n2000\tP_WEXIT\t\t\tProcess is working on exiting\n4000\tP_EXEC      \t\tProcess has called exec()" = "以十六进制数字表示的进程标志\n\n这是由以下标志组成的位掩码：\n0001\tP_ADVLOCK\t\t进程可能持有 POSIX 建议锁\n0002\tP_CONTROLT    \t拥有控制终端\n0004\tP_LP64 \t\t\t64 位进程\n0008\tP_NOCLDSTOP \t子进程停止时不向父进程发送 SIGCHLD\n0010\tP_PPWAIT    \t\t父进程正在等待此子进程执行或退出\n0020\tP_PROFIL    \t\t已启动性能分析\n0040\tP_SELECT    \t\t正在选择；存在唤醒/等待风险\n0080\tP_CONTINUED  \t进程曾停止后又继续\n0100\tP_SUGID\t\t\t自上次执行以来已设置权限\n0200\tP_SYSTEM    \t\t系统进程：不接收信号、不统计或换出\n0400\tP_TIMEOUT\t\t休眠期间超时\n0800\tP_TRACED    \t\t调试进程正在被跟踪\n1000\tP_DISABLE_ASLR\t禁用地址空间随机化\n2000\tP_WEXIT\t\t\t进程正在退出\n4000\tP_EXEC      \t\t进程已调用 exec()";
"Virtual address space usage.\n\nThis includes address space taken by dynamic libraries." = "虚拟地址空间使用\n\n这包括动态库占用的地址空间。";
"Effective (current) user id.\n\nSummary of this column denotes the number of processes executing as user (aka 'mobile')." = "有效（当前）用户id。\n\n此列汇总以 mobile 用户身份运行的进程数。";
"Number of threads in the process.\n\nTap the process and go to 'Threads' pane for lots of details." = "进程中的线程数。\n\n点击进程并转到“Threads”窗口以获取大量详细信息。";
"Number of Mach ports opened by the process.\n\nMach ports are the primary means of low-level communication with the kernel and between the processes in a microkernel environment." = "进程打开的Mach端口数量。\n\nMach端口是在微内核环境中与内核以及进程之间进行低级通信的主要手段。";
"Number of Mach system calls per update interval.\n\nMach system calls are calls to the Mach microkernel within the XNU kernel. There are 180 to 200 Mach services available on iOS depending on kernel version." = "每个更新间隔的Mach系统调用数。\n\nMach系统调用是对XNU内核中Mach微内核的调用。iOS上有180到200 Mach的服务，具体取决于内核版本。";
"Number of BSD system calls per update interval.\n\nBSD system calls are calls to the BSD part of the XNU kernel. There are almost 1000 BSD services available on iOS depending on kernel version." = "每个更新间隔的BSD系统调用数。\n\nBSD系统调用是对XNU内核的BSD部分的调用。iOS上有近1000个BSD服务，具体取决于内核版本。";
"Number of context switches by this process per update interval.\n\nThis is the number of times the CPU has activated this process to execute its code.\n\nSummary of this column indicates total number of context switches per update interval." = "此进程在每个更新间隔中进行的上下文切换数。\n\n这是CPU激活该进程以执行其代码的次数。\n\n此列的摘要指示每个更新间隔的上下文开关总数。";
"The highest priority of a thread within the process. Can be prefixed by the process' default scheduling scheme.\n\nThere are several scheduling schemes supported by Mach, 'Time Sharing' being the default. The other two, 'Round-Robin' and 'FIFO', will be marked in this column using prefixes R: and F: respectively. Tap the process and go to 'Threads' pane to see actual priorities and scheduling schemes of every thread." = "进程中线程的最高优先级可以用进程的默认调度方案作为前缀。\n\nMach支持几种调度方案，“时间共享”是默认设置。另外两个，'Round-Robin'和'FIFO'，将分别使用前缀R:和F:在本列中标记。点击进程并转到“Threads”窗口，查看每个线程的实际优先级和调度方案。";
"The base thread priority of a process.\n\nThis is the default priority set for newly created threads. Tap the process and go to 'Threads' pane to see actual priorities and scheduling schemes of existing threads." = "进程的基本线程优先级。\n\n这是新建线程的默认优先级。轻点进程并打开“线程”页面，即可查看现有线程的实际优先级和调度策略。";
"A positive 'nice' value lowers the priority of the process' threads. A negative value raises the priority.\n\nThis is also indicated in the 'Process State' column by symbols ▼ and ▲ respectively." = "正值“nice”会降低进程线程的优先级。负值会提高优先级。\n\n这也会分别通过“进程状态”列中的 ▼ 和 ▲ 符号表示。";
"The assigned role for GUI apps (Mac-specific). This may not be shown on older iOS versions.\n\nPossible values are:\nNone     \t\tNon-UI task\nForeground \tNormal UI application in the foreground\nInactive \t\tNormal UI application in the background\nBackground\tOS X: Normal UI application in the background\nController\t\tOS X: Controller service application\nGfxServer \t\tOS X: Graphics management (window) server\nThrottle \t\tOS X: Throttle application\n\nSummary of this column denotes the number of GUI processes (user applications)." = "界面应用被分配的角色（Mac 专用）。旧版 iOS 可能不显示此项。\n\n可能的值为：\nNone     \t\t非界面任务\nForeground \t前台的普通界面应用\nInactive \t\t后台的普通界面应用\n后台操作系统X：后台的普通UI应用程序\nController\t\tOS X：控制器服务应用\nGfxServer \t\tOS X：图形管理（窗口）服务\nThrottle \t\tOS X：限流应用\n\n此列的摘要表示GUI进程（用户应用程序）的数量。";
"Total Mach messages sent by the process.\n\nMessages are sent using Mach ports. Also see 'Mach Ports' column." = "进程发送的 Mach 消息总数。\n\n使用Mach端口发送消息另请参阅“Mach端口”栏。";
"Total Mach messages received by the process.\n\nMessages are received using Mach ports. Also see 'Mach Ports' column." = "进程接收的 Mach 消息总数。\n\n使用Mach端口接收消息另请参阅“Mach端口”栏。";
"Total number of Mach system calls by the process.\n\nAlso see 'Mach System Calls (Delta)' column." = "进程调用Mach系统的总数。\n\n另请参阅“Mach系统调用（差值）”栏。";
"Total number of BSD system calls by the process.\n\nAlso see 'BSD System Calls (Delta)' column." = "进程调用BSD系统的总数。\n\n另请参阅“BSD 系统调用（差值）”列。";
"Total number of context switches by this process.\n\nAlso see 'Context Switches (Delta)' column." = "此进程进行的上下文切换的总数。\n\n另请参阅“上下文切换（差值）”列。";
"Number of active file descriptors opened by process.\n\nThis includes open files, pipes, network sockets, kernel sockets, and kernel queues. Tap the process and go to 'Open Files' pane for lots of details." = "进程打开的活动文件描述符数。\n\n这包括打开的文件、管道、网络套接字、内核套接字和内核队列,点击进程并转到“Open Files”窗口以获取大量详细信息。";
"Number of active socket descriptors opened by process.\n\nThis includes IP network sockets, UNIX, and XNU kernel sockets. Tap the process and go to 'Open Files' pane for details." = "进程打开的活动套接字描述符数。\n\n这包括IP网络套接字、UNIX和XNU内核套接字。点击进程并转到“Open Files”窗口以了解详细信息。";
"Network bytes received by process since launch.\n\nThis value is inaccurate due to the fact that CocoaTop can only monitor process' sockets while it is active. Sockets having a lifetime during CocoaTop being inactive are not counted." = "自启动以来进程接收的网络字节数。\n\n此值并不精确，因为 CocoaTop 只能在自身运行时监控进程的套接字。在 CocoaTop 未运行期间创建并关闭的套接字不会计入。";
"Network bytes transmitted by process since launch.\n\nThis value is inaccurate due to the fact that CocoaTop can only monitor process' sockets while it is active. Sockets having a lifetime during CocoaTop being inactive are not counted." = "自启动以来进程传输的网络字节数。\n\n此值并不精确，因为 CocoaTop 只能在自身运行时监控进程的套接字。在 CocoaTop 未运行期间创建并关闭的套接字不会计入。";
"Network packets received by process since launch.\n\nThis value is inaccurate due to the fact that CocoaTop can only monitor process' sockets while it is active. Sockets having a lifetime during CocoaTop being inactive are not counted." = "自启动以来进程接收到的网络数据包。\n\n此值并不精确，因为 CocoaTop 只能在自身运行时监控进程的套接字。在 CocoaTop 未运行期间创建并关闭的套接字不会计入。";
"Network packets transmitted by process since launch.\n\nThis value is inaccurate due to the fact that CocoaTop can only monitor process' sockets while it is active. Sockets having a lifetime during CocoaTop being inactive are not counted." = "自启动以来由进程传输的网络数据包。\n\n此值并不精确，因为 CocoaTop 只能在自身运行时监控进程的套接字。在 CocoaTop 未运行期间创建并关闭的套接字不会计入。";
"Number of interrupt wakeups by this process per update interval.\n\nThis is the number of times the process was activated by the kernel due to a hardware interrupt." = "此进程在每个更新间隔内的中断唤醒次数。\n\n这是内核由于硬件中断而激活进程的次数。";
"Physical memory footprint.\n\nThis is the most accurate RAM usage data by process." = "物理内存占用。\n\n这是按进程划分的最准确的RAM使用数据。";
"Process state (similar to original top).\n\nCan be one of the following:\nR    Running: at least one thread within this process is running now\nU    Uninterruptible (Stuck): a thread is waiting on I/O in a system call\nS    Sleeping: all threads of a process are sleeping\nI    Idle: all threads are sleeping for at least 20 seconds\nT    Terminated: all threads stopped\nH    Halted: all threads halted at a clean point\nD    The process is stopped by a signal (can be used for debugging)\nZ    Zombie: awaiting termination or 'orphan'\n?    Running state is unknown (access to threads was denied)\n\nAdditional process attributes can follow:\n▼    Nice: lower priority, also see 'Nice' column\n▲    Not nice: higher priority\nt    Debugged process is being traced\nz    Process is being terminated at the moment\nw    Process' parent is waiting for this child after fork\nK    The system process (kernel)\nB    Application is suspended by SpringBoard (iOS specific)\n\nSummary of this column shows two numbers: the first one is the count of processes in running state, the second one is the number of CPU cores. Sometimes there are more running processes than there are CPU cores, but this is just a glitch due to kernel state changing while data is collected." = "进程状态(和原来的top类似)。\n\n可以是以下内容之一：\nR    运行：进程中至少有一个线程正在运行\nU    不可中断（阻塞）：线程正在系统调用中等待 I/O\nS睡眠：进程的所有线程都在睡眠\nI  Idle：所有线程至少休眠20秒\nT已终止：所有线程已停止\nH停止：所有线程在干净的点停止\nD进程被信号停止（可用于调试）\nZ   僵尸进程:正在等待终止或者已经成为孤儿进程的进程。”\n？运行状态未知（拒绝访问线程）\n\n其他过程属性如下：\n▼    较低优先级，另请参阅“Nice”列\n▲    更高优先级\nt    调试进程正在被跟踪\nZ进程目前正在终止\nW进程的父进程正在fork之后等待此子进程\nK    系统进程（内核）\nB    应用已被 SpringBoard 挂起（仅限 iOS）\n\n该列的摘要显示了两个数字：第一个是处于运行状态的进程数，第二个是CPU内核数。有时运行的进程比CPU内核多，但这只是由于收集数据时内核状态发生变化而导致的故障。";
"Process flags represented as a hexadecimal number.\n\nThis is a bitmask composed of the following:\n0001    P_ADVLOCK        Process may hold POSIX adv. lock\n0002    P_CONTROLT        Has a controlling terminal\n0004    P_LP64             64-bit process\n0008    P_NOCLDSTOP     Bad parent: no SIGCHLD when child stops\n0010    P_PPWAIT        \tParent is waiting for this child to exec/exit\n0020    P_PROFIL        \tHas started profiling\n0040    P_SELECT        \tSelecting; wakeup/waiting danger\n0080    P_CONTINUED      Process was stopped and continued\n0100    P_SUGID            Has set privileges since last exec\n0200    P_SYSTEM        \tSystem process: no signals, stats or swap\n0400    P_TIMEOUT        Timing out during sleep\n0800    P_TRACED        \tDebugged process being traced\n1000    P_DISABLE_ASLR    Disable address space randomization\n2000    P_WEXIT            Process is working on exiting\n4000    P_EXEC          \tProcess has called exec()" = "以十六进制数字表示的进程标志\n\n这是由以下标志组成的位掩码：\n0001    P_ADVLOCK        进程可能持有 POSIX 建议锁\n0002    P_CONTROLT        拥有控制终端\n0004    P_LP64             64 位进程\n0008    P_NOCLDSTOP     子进程停止时不向父进程发送 SIGCHLD\n0010    P_PPWAIT        \t父进程正在等待此子进程执行或退出\n0020    P_PROFIL        \t已启动性能分析\n0040    P_SELECT        \t正在选择；存在唤醒/等待风险\n0080    P_CONTINUED      进程曾停止后又继续\n0100    P_SUGID            自上次执行以来已设置权限\n0200    P_SYSTEM        \t系统进程：不接收信号、不统计或换出\n0400    P_TIMEOUT        休眠期间超时\n0800    P_TRACED        \t调试进程正在被跟踪\n1000    P_DISABLE_ASLR    禁用地址空间随机化\n2000    P_WEXIT            进程正在退出\n4000    P_EXEC          \t进程已调用 exec()";
"The assigned role for GUI apps (Mac-specific). This may not be shown on older iOS versions.\n\nPossible values are:\nNone         \tNon-UI task\nForeground \tNormal UI application in the foreground\nInactive     \tNormal UI application in the background\nBackground    OS X: Normal UI application in the background\nController    \tOS X: Controller service application\nGfxServer     \tOS X: Graphics management (window) server\nThrottle     \tOS X: Throttle application\n\nSummary of this column denotes the number of GUI processes (user applications)." = "界面应用被分配的角色（Mac 专用）。旧版 iOS 可能不显示此项。\n\n可能的值为：\nNone         \t非界面任务\nForeground \t前台的普通界面应用\nInactive     \t后台的普通界面应用\n后台操作系统X：后台的普通UI应用程序\nController    \tOS X：控制器服务应用\nGfxServer     \tOS X：图形管理（窗口）服务\nThrottle     \tOS X：限流应用\n\n此列的摘要表示GUI进程（用户应用程序）的数量。";
